8. B2B / WHOLESALE PORTAL
A separate, clearly signposted area (/b2b) in the same design language, with a more business-focused tone.
• Landing: value props (margin, MOQ, customisation, export-ready, repeat ordering), client logos and case studies (hotels, boutiques, designers), testimonials, 'Apply for wholesale account'.
• Application and onboarding: business type, GSTIN (format-validated, verification-ready), IEC for exporters, address, expected volume, documents upload; admin approval with email status.
• Wholesale pricing: tiered price breaks (e.g. 10/25/50/100+ units), MOQ per SKU, case-pack sizes, price visible only to approved accounts, currency switch (INR, USD, EUR, AED, GBP) for export.
• Bulk tools: quick-order table (SKU and quantity), CSV upload, reorder previous orders, saved lists/templates, multi-address shipping.
• Quote and RFQ: request-for-quote form with custom design, colour, packaging and branding (white-label and private label); quote thread with attachments; convert quote to order.
• Samples: sample-order flow with limited quantity and credit-back on bulk order.
• Catalogue: downloadable PDF line-sheets and lookbooks (auto-generated per category), seasonal collection previews.
• Payments and credit: advance, proforma invoice, bank transfer/NEFT details, Razorpay payment links, Net-15/30 credit for approved accounts, GST invoices with HSN codes and e-way bill fields.
• Corporate gifting builder: pick a budget and quantity, choose products, add logo and message cards, preview packaging, and get an instant quote.
• Dashboard: orders, invoices, credit balance, quotes, saved lists, dedicated account manager contact with WhatsApp button, margin and savings calculator.
• Export info: shipping terms (FOB/CIF/DDP), lead times, compliance and certifications, HS codes, FAQs.
